On Sunday, October 19, 2014 9:19:33 PM UTC-3, guskant wrote:
>
> La jbovlaste allows it based on peg morphology, and la gleki and I don't 
> agree to the new rule. Concretely, an experimental cmavo "jie'e'e" is now 
